                                "sense_id": "42a6e924-19bd-35fb-a083-6e8a43927298",
                                "text": "G. Fletcher\nHow may weak mortal ever hope to file\nHis unsmooth tongue, and his deprostrate style?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "339f187a-1a42-45bd-86fb-b168fcc0ae70",
                                "sense_id": "42a6e924-19bd-35fb-a083-6e8a43927298",
                                "text": "In contrast, treatment with the uncleavable Alexa-labelled Ub-3A-G75A/G76A–CPP Tat resulted in an unsmooth and heterogeneous pattern of fluorescence in the cells, with intense staining of cytoplasmic components and nucleoli."
                            }
                        ]
